        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LVG150SBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Wooden Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Wooden Door Handle is from First Impressions' Livingston Collection, which features a solid wood grip with wrap around mounts. The 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Wood Door Handle is available in 3 lengths: 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch. It is available in any of <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"> different types of wood</a> including mahogany and cherry; and the brass rackets can be finished in the color of your choosing for a totally customizable door handle that can suit both commercial and residential applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Livingston 150 Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LVG02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>First Impressions LVG150SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LVG150012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LVG150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LVG150036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Diameter Wood Door Handle",
                "description": "This Wooden Door Handle is from First Impressions' Livingston Collection, which features a solid wood grip with wrap around mounts. The 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Wood Door Handle is available in 3 lengths: 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch. It is available in any of different types of wood including mahogany and cherry; and the brass rackets can be finished in the color of your choosing for a totally customizable door handle that can suit both commercial and residential applications. \r\n",
